{"schemaVersion":1,"id":44,"sections":[{"id":"116007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1470],"start":0,"count":14},{"id":"116007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11460],"start":14,"count":6},{"id":"116008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1480],"start":20,"count":8},{"id":"116008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11470],"start":28,"count":10},{"id":"116009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1490],"start":38,"count":7},{"id":"116009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11480],"start":45,"count":21}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:2","scriptId":1470,"text":"埃普西隆确确实实得挨了一发“铁拳”，这点损伤足以让她战斗力大减。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:3","scriptId":1470,"text":"“开什么玩笑！区区人类竟然让我受伤了！简直是不可饶恕！！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:4","scriptId":1470,"text":"埃普西隆咆哮着向指挥官所在的吉普车冲去，由于之前为了伪装逃跑，所以吉普车的引擎处在关闭状态，不能立即发动。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:5","scriptId":1470,"text":"虽然有伊诺不停得在发动攻击，但是由于埃普西隆警戒着她的攻击方位，因此并没有办法对埃普西隆造成威胁，炮弹都被无效化了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:6","scriptId":1470,"text":"（这下死定了……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:7","scriptId":1470,"text":"正当埃普西隆瞄准吉普车准备发动攻击的时候，另一发炮弹从侧面击中了埃普西隆！","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:8","scriptId":1470,"text":"“唔……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:9","scriptId":1470,"text":"原来是佐伊！她终于及时赶了上来！这一发炮弹彻底打断了埃普西隆的攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:10","scriptId":1470,"text":"“长官，你没事吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":32,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:11","scriptId":1470,"text":"“恩！真是爱死你了！我以为自己这下必死无疑了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":35,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:12","scriptId":1470,"text":"“哪里～我只是做了应该做的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":35,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:13","scriptId":1470,"text":"“不过只有你一个最先赶到，或多或少还是不太够啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":35,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:14","scriptId":1470,"text":"“这群该死的杂碎！像苍蝇一样东一个西一个，真是烦死我了！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":35,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-PROLOGUE:1470:15","scriptId":1470,"text":"虽然埃普西隆已经明显受伤，但是由于前方战车兽大军也已经赶到了，从数量上来说战局对我们非常不利。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":35,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:1","scriptId":11460,"text":"纵使埃普西隆受了伤，但是大量的战车兽的出现使局势一下子反转了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":35,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:2","scriptId":11460,"text":"“希望我们能撑到芙琳她们赶到……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":35,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:3","scriptId":11460,"text":"“应该没什么问题，埃普西隆不行动的话，我们还能撑得住。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":176,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:4","scriptId":11460,"text":"“听远处的火炮声，芙琳她们应该快到了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":176,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:5","scriptId":11460,"text":"一边抵御着敌人的攻击，一边还在祈祷芙琳她们快点到来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":176,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116007-EPILOGUE:11460:6","scriptId":11460,"text":"（但是埃普西隆竟然没有主动进攻，心里总觉得不踏实，以她的性格来说负伤作战并没什么大不了的才对……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:2","scriptId":1480,"text":"就在双方展开拉锯战的时候，芙琳她们赶到了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":120,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:3","scriptId":1480,"text":"“对不起，长官，我们来迟了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":31,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:4","scriptId":1480,"text":"“并没来迟啦，你们干得很好，这下我们可以转守为攻了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":133,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:5","scriptId":1480,"text":"“虽然这么说有点打击士气，但是我们过来的时候也引来了另一批战车兽……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":133,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":504,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:6","scriptId":1480,"text":"“对不起……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:7","scriptId":1480,"text":"“这……好吧，大家没事就好。看到埃普西隆迟迟未动，我们准备开溜吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:8","scriptId":1480,"text":"“诶？这就走了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-PROLOGUE:1480:9","scriptId":1480,"text":"“既然你们都平安无事，那么当然要准备闪了，本来的任务就是侦察，现在已经120%完成任务了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:0","scriptId":11470,"text":"准备撤离，但是那边的战车兽并没有打算让我们轻易撤离的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:2","scriptId":11470,"text":"“对面靠数量优势封锁了我们的行动范围……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:3","scriptId":11470,"text":"“我去探探路。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:4","scriptId":11470,"text":"佐伊刚准备离开掩体，被我伸手拦住……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:5","scriptId":11470,"text":"“稍安勿躁，现在需要等待对面的主动露出破绽，不要冒然出击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:6","scriptId":11470,"text":"“侦察方面已经派米佳去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:7","scriptId":11470,"text":"话音未落，就听到无线电里传来米佳慌慌张张的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":504,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:8","scriptId":11470,"text":"“长官！不好了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":504,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:9","scriptId":11470,"text":"“不要慌张，挑重点说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":504,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":500,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116008-EPILOGUE:11470:10","scriptId":11470,"text":"“前方出现4只埃普西隆！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:2","scriptId":1490,"text":"听到米佳惊慌失措的声音，我叹了口气……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:3","scriptId":1490,"text":"（佐伊肯定没把埃普西隆会分身的事情告诉米佳她们吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:4","scriptId":1490,"text":"我整理了下思路，心平气和地说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:5","scriptId":1490,"text":"“不用慌张，这是埃普西隆的能力——分身，不过分身除了火力高以外并没有防弹的能力，就把她们当高级的战车兽就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:6","scriptId":1490,"text":"“优先把埃普西隆的分身干掉就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":185,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:7","scriptId":1490,"text":"“话虽如此，但是我们并没有多余的兵力来对付埃普西隆的分身啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-PROLOGUE:1490:8","scriptId":1490,"text":"伊诺说的没错，虽说埃普西隆的分身不算很强，但是我们未必经得起她的消耗，如果有援军就好了……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:1","scriptId":11480,"text":"双方交战了没几个回合，我们这边因为人数不足的原因，只能步步后撤，但是退着退着却发现已经退无可退……我们被包围了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:2","scriptId":11480,"text":"通过战车兽的数量庞大的火力限制住我们的行动，埃普西隆的分身开始使用强大的火力拆解我们的掩体！","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:3","scriptId":11480,"text":"埃普西隆的分身火力很高，估计不需要多久就能把我们前面的掩体完全粉碎。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:4","scriptId":11480,"text":"感觉自己就像砧板上的鱼，只能慢慢等待悲惨的命运降临。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:5","scriptId":11480,"text":"“已经没有退路了……要不我们冲出去和埃普西隆拼了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:6","scriptId":11480,"text":"佐伊的话语中带有冲动的情绪。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:7","scriptId":11480,"text":"不过面对生死攸关的情况，如果没有些情绪那反倒会让人觉得奇怪。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:8","scriptId":11480,"text":"“现在连出去反击的机会都不给，如果现在冒然出击，容易被直接秒杀。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:9","scriptId":11480,"text":"“没关系，如果能给你们争取到撤退时间的话，我这条命也值了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":36,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:10","scriptId":11480,"text":"“佐伊！不要意气用事，现在是忍耐的时候！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":36,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":34,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:11","scriptId":11480,"text":"“但是……但是这样下去我们不是都会全军覆没吗！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":34,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:12","scriptId":11480,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":34,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:13","scriptId":11480,"text":"（没错……就如佐伊说的那样，如果有人做出牺牲的话，至少可以避免全灭……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":34,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:14","scriptId":11480,"text":"看了一下手下的小队成员们，如果现在不下决断，可能真的会造成无法挽回的结果……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":34,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:15","scriptId":11480,"text":"正当我陷入进退两难的时候，埃普西隆那边发生了异变，战车兽群发出了不安的躁动。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":34,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":58,"speaker":"钢甲鬣蜥","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:18","scriptId":11480,"text":"“嘶嘶！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":58,"section":5,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:19","scriptId":11480,"text":"原来是侧面受到攻击，战车兽群的包围网开始变得有些散乱。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":58,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:20","scriptId":11480,"text":"紧接着我们看到了索菲亚教官和另一名钢舞姬战车兽群的侧面发动了攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":58,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:21","scriptId":11480,"text":"“是教官！！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":58,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:22","scriptId":11480,"text":"佐伊兴奋得叫了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":58,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116009-EPILOGUE:11480:23","scriptId":11480,"text":"“恩，侦查任务做得不错，值得嘉奖。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["战局正在紧张进行中","埃普西隆一直不进攻，有点奇怪。","埃普西隆的分身"]}
